     $$ \text{Sign Change} \iff g(t_{prev}) \cdot g(t_{curr}) < 0 $$
     *Note: Some implementations check for $f(\mathbf{p}) \ge \tau$ directly [S2, S6, unofficial], but sign change is more robust for general scalar fields [S4, unofficial].*
